Cell["\<\
bnsdict is an Association containing all 1651 BNS-number pairs in the bundled \
magnetic-space-group database.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"12c3e8e4-ee0f-484b-a5b7-9adf587e931e"],

Cell["\<\
Pass the returned integer to msgop or showMSGWyckoff. It is a database \
identifier, not an operation list.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"f6f3aa13-76a0-400f-88b5-f721d3616735"],

Cell["\<\
The values of typeI, gray, typeIII, and typeIV partition the same 1651 \
identifiers. Use bnsdict when the complete BNS pair is already known.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7a9e96cd-4e2c-4423-bb5d-b8600a4df083"]
}, Closed]],

